MONGODB_URI=[Put here your MongoDB connection string, from MongoDB Atlas]

NEXT_PUBLIC_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=[Put here the Cloudflare Turnstile site key, public, safe to expose to the browser]
TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=[Put here the Cloudflare Turnstile secret key, from the Turnstile widget dashboard, keep private]
TURNSTILE_HOSTNAMES=[Put here comma-separated hostnames allowed by Cloudflare Turnstile, e.g. naktside.com,localhost]
CONTACT_EMAIL=[Put here the email address to reveal once a visitor passes the Turnstile check]
